\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 ng. S\u7889\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn thu\'ea t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn l\'e0 quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\u7845\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 t }{
