t gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f b\u7857\'3fng v\u7899\'3fi gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f h\u7907\'3fp l\'fd c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn thu\'ea t\u7841\'3fi th\u7901\'3fi }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 i\u7875\'3fm kh
\u7903\'3fi }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\u7847\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 u thu\'ea t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn. N\u7871\'3fu gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f h\u7907\'3fp l\'fd c\u7911\'3fa t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn thu\'ea cao h}{
\f54\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f5}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 n gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f hi\u7879\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa kho\u7843\'3fn thanh to\'e1n ti\u7873\'3fn thu\'ea t\u7889\'3fi thi\u7875\'3fu cho vi\u7879\'3fc thu\'ea t\'e0i s
\u7843\'3fn th\'ec ghi theo gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f hi\u7879\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa kho\u7843\'3fn thanh to\'e1n ti\u7873\'3fn thu\'ea t\u7889\'3fi thi\u7875\'3fu. T\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f chi\u7871\'3ft kh\u7845\'3fu }{
\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\u7875\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121  t\'ednh gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f hi\u7879\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa kho\u7843\'3fn thanh to\'e1n ti\u7873\'3fn thu\'ea t\u7889\'3fi thi\u7875\'3fu cho vi\u7879\'3f
c thu\'ea t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn l\'e0 l\'e3i su\u7845\'3ft ng\u7847\'3fm }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\u7883\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 nh trong h\u7907\'3fp }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\u7891\'3f}{
\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 ng thu\'ea t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn ho\u7863\'3fc l\'e3i su\u7845\'3ft ghi trong h\u7907\'3fp }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\u7891\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 ng. Tr}{
