\'3fa b\'ean thu\'ea t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\u7875\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121  t\'ednh gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f hi\u7879\'3fn t\u7841\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa kho\u7843\'3fn thanh to\'e1n ti\u7873\'3fn thu\'ea t
\u7889\'3fi thi\u7875\'3fu.
\par 14. Khi tr\'ecnh b\'e0y c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn n\u7907\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f v\u7873\'3f thu\'ea t\'e0i ch\'ednh trong b\'e1o c\'e1o t\'e0i ch\'ednh, ph\u7843\'3fi ph\'e2n bi\u7879\'3ft n\u7907\'3f ng\u7855\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn v\'e0 n\u7907\'3f d
\'e0i h\u7841\'3fn.
\par 15. Chi ph\'ed tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp ph\'e1t sinh ban }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\u7847\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 u li\'ean quan }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\u7871\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 
n ho\u7841\'3ft }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\u7897\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 ng thu\'ea t\'e0i ch\'ednh, nh}{\f54\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'fd}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121  chi ph\'ed }{
\f54\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\'e0}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 m ph\'e1n k\'fd h\u7907\'3fp }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\u7891\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 ng }{\f54\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\'fd\u7907
\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 c ghi nh\u7853\'3fn v\'e0o nguy\'ean gi\'e1 t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 i thu\'ea.
\par 16. Kho\u7843\'3fn thanh to\'e1n ti\u7873\'3fn thu\'ea t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn thu\'ea t\'e0i ch\'ednh ph\u7843\'3fi }{\f54\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 c chia ra th\'e0nh chi ph\'ed t\'e0i ch\'ednh v
\'e0 kho\u7843\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f g\u7889\'3fc. Chi ph\'ed t\'e0i ch\'ednh ph\u7843\'3fi }{\f54\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 c t\'ednh theo t\u7915\'3fng k\u7923\'3f k\u7871
\'3f to\'e1n trong su\u7889\'3ft th\u7901\'3fi h\u7841\'3fn thu\'ea theo t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f l\'e3i su\u7845\'3ft }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\u7883\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 nh k\u7923\'3f c\u7889\'3f }{
\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\u7883\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 nh tr\'ean s\u7889\'3f d}{\f54\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'fd}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121  n\u7907\'3f c\'f2n l\u7841\'3fi cho m\u7895\'3fi k\u7923\'3f k
\u7871\'3f to\'e1n.
\par 17. Thu\'ea t\'e0i ch\'ednh s\u7869\'3f ph\'e1t sinh chi ph\'ed kh\u7845\'3fu hao t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn v\'e0 chi ph\'ed t\'e0i ch\'ednh cho m\u7895\'3fi k\u7923\'3f k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n. Ch\'ednh s\'e1ch kh\u7845\'3fu hao t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn thu\'ea ph
\u7843\'3fi nh\u7845\'3ft qu\'e1n v\u7899\'3fi ch\'ednh s\'e1ch kh\u7845\'3fu hao t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\'f9ng lo\u7841\'3fi thu\u7897\'3fc s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu c\u7911\'3fa doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0}{
\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 i thu\'ea. N\u7871\'3fu kh\'f4ng ch\u7855\'3fc ch\u7855\'3fn l\'e0 b\'ean thu\'ea s\u7869\'3f c\'f3 quy\u7873\'3fn s\u7903\'3f h\u7919\'3fu t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn khi h\u7871\'3ft h\u7841\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp }{
