\u7911\'3fa n\'f3.
\par 18. Khi tr\'ecnh b\'e0y t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn thu\'ea trong b\'e1o c\'e1o t\'e0i ch\'ednh ph\u7843\'3fi tu\'e2n th\u7911\'3f c\'e1c quy }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0\u7883\'3f}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 nh c\u7911\'3fa Chu\u7849\'3fn m
