 t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn, kh\'f4ng ph\u7909\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc v\'e0o ph}{\f54\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'fd\'f5}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 ng th\u7913\'3fc thanh to\'e1n, tr\u7915\'3f khi \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng ph}{
