\par 22. Vi\u7879\'3fc ghi nh\u7853\'3fn doanh thu t\'e0i ch\'ednh ph\u7843\'3fi d\u7921\'3fa tr\'ean c}{\f54\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f5}{\f0\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121  s\u7903\'3f l\'e3i su\u7845\'3ft }{\f46\insrsid6573121\charrsid6573121 \'f0
